Hello!

An update has been successfully added to the game servers, mainly related to bug fixes.

List of innovations and fixes:
- Made changes to some missions;
- Corrected for the "Freeze" mode. The account is now saved;
- Amendments to the mode "Snowballs". Improved the mechanics of the flight of shells;
- The game added gift winter skins on the G36C and FMG-9, which are issued as a reward for passing missions and are not sold in the store. Players who complete missions will receive these skins immediately to their inventory. The skins authors are given these skins for free (if the skin author managed to complete all the missions, then he will receive 50 coins instead of the skins);
- Fixed installation of blocks on maps for all modes;
- Easter eggs and New Year's Eve festive were removed;
- Fixed faces;
- Fixed collision of grenades with blocks;
- Fixed an invisible store at type99;
- Fixed invisible front sight at F2000;
- Other minor fixes.

Enjoy all the game!

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/7404960/9a713351457c562873941e0cd0b35e67840e9111.png[/img]
[b]Greetings friend![/b]

We are pleased to announce that an updated version of the Blockade 3D game is being released today. Today opens a new page in the history of the project. And our team is very happy about what we were able to achieve during this time!

We understand that we did not have time to finish some of the content that we planned to prepare for the Global Update. All that we did not have time to finish, we will add gradually. The list of scheduled updates includes old and new modes, items, improved current modes, edit items balance, improved protection, clans and rating battles, bug fixes and much more.

In the coming days, we will work on fixing bugs, adding content, preparing a Christmas update.

Below is a list of game changes:
- In-game currency added to the game;
- Added modules and skins for weapons;
- Added the ability to upgrade weapons;
- For upgrading weapons added "weapon points", which can be obtained for killing the enemy. 1 point = 100 experience (changes are possible);
- The weapon now has its own level and indicator of the current upgrade;
- Fully redesigned physics and graphics of the game;
- Rebalance all items in the game. Some items are still blocked, but will be added to the game soon;
- Changed animations for weapons and characters;
- Changed menu design and combat interface;
- Reworked clans. In the future will be improved;
- Replaced all sounds;
- Reworked character customization system;
- Reworked maps and textures of blocks;
- Changed the cost of all items;
- Reworked character leveling system.
- Changed the system "friend or foe";
- Reworked minimap. You can open the map (M), zoom in and out (+, -). On the minimap you can now see opponents. Opponents that your allies see will now also appear on the minimap;
- Reworked game modes. Some modes are temporarily unavailable;
- Added rating and level servers. Temporarily turned off;
- Added daily missions with awards;
- Reworked bonuses for the level (temporarily up to level 20);
- Added boxes;
- Added other options for gaining experience (assistant, base capture, victory / defeat, support of allies with ammunition and treatment);
- Changed the system of nicknames. Now free nickname can be changed only 3 times;
- Added the ability to register multiple characters on the same account. Coins for the account are common;
- All players are given gifts in honor of the Global Update.

This is only a part of all the changes that the Global Update brought. We hope that you will enjoy the new Blockade, and our works will not be in vain! Thanks to everyone who stayed with us all this time and supported the project. Without you, we would have failed;)


[b]Thank you all for your attention! Good luck to all the game![/b]

