Good time of the day for the fighters of the Blockade and the peaceful members of our community.

Phantoms of the past years have risen from the graves! The server has successfully installed the update devoted to the holiday of Halloween. All the players were given presents!

List of changes:
[list]
[*]Players are given gifts (If you have problems with the gift or the gift itself, we recommend that you update the game page several times or clean the game cache);
[*]Added 3 new weapons: Flamethrower, Saiga, FMG9;
[*]Added 8 new skins: Scientist, Harley, Saw, Assassin, Penny, Joker, Scarecrow, Skeleton;
[*]In the store you can buy Halloween skins from past updates;
[*]In the coming days, new maps will be added to the game!
Battle Mode: WINTER CASTLE, ISLAND 2017;
Contra: ARENA, ZAKOULOV, RUINY 2017, STORM;
Massacre: ANGAR2, COSMO, MONOCHROM, OPISTION;
[*]Grenade M61 replaced with a pumpkin;
[*]Background of the game, music on the menu and the sky are replaced by festive;
[*]Until November 1 (inclusive) on the servers will appear spirits, which can be damaged only by the explosives! Spirits will hunt for players. You can get experience for killing spirits!
[*]Skins from the Halloween section will be removed from the sale along with the festive decoration after the update is completed.
[*]Make sure you open your present before buying new skins, otherwise you might not get your free skin!
[/list]

The contents of the gifts: One random skin (Penny, Joker, Scarecrow or Skeleton), 30 small first-aid kits, 20 medium-sized first-aid kits, 10 large first-aid kits, 50 shmels, 200 grenades m61, 50 pumpkin-heads (can be removed), 25 rpg, 25 molotov cocktails, 200 reinforced blocks.

